    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/7/77325.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 15,
    "turn_text": "And look, this is an undeniable takeaway of this first five months or so is that the president is undefeated in the ballot box in these big elections. And for all the talk of the backlash against President Trump, we're not seeing it. It's just not, it's not, it's not happening. And if it doesn't happen in Georgia, where you have this district that's already predisposed to not like him, and And all the money that poured into there, if the Democrats can't pull that off, it's raising questions about where they can pull it off. And it has them twisting in knots right now because they see the evidence of a president that is spiraling and his approval ratings are low. And they can't take",
