    "turn_text": "So I struck by a quote in the papers today from you. I think it was the New York Times where you said that our brand right now is Democrats is worse than Trump's, worse than Trump's. Talk about that because you look at the polling and Trump's got an approval rating in the 30s and quite a bit worse in some parts of the country, some better in others. But you really think Democratic Party's in a worse spot than Donald Trump?",
